translated_text:
Article 19
(1) Implementation of Protection for women with disabilities in order to provide protection and prevention against forms of discrimination including freedom from cruel treatment, inhumane treatment, degrading human dignity and freedom from exploitation;
(2) Women with disabilities as referred to in paragraph (1) shall receive the right to protection for: a. guarantee of continuity and personal self-development;
